@1 = ~Young people like you should work hard in the fields instead of procrastinating and daydreaming. If you're done with your shenanigans, carry some flour over to me. I'll pay you a small price, just to encourage more hard work from you. I could use corn as well, and I've a few eggs to sell.~
@2 = ~Let me see what you have for sale.~
@3 = ~I have some flour. Will you pay 60 gold pieces?~
@4 = ~I have some corn. Will you pay 25 gold pieces?~
@5 = ~Maybe another time.~
